----      ---           -----         ---
acute     \acute        \acute
Acute                   \Acute
bar       \bar          \bar          bar
Bar                     \Bar
breve     \breve        \breve
Breve                   \Breve
check     \check        \check
Check                   \Check
dddot                   \dddot
ddddot                  \ddddot
dot       \dot          \dot          dot
Dot                     \Dot
dotdot    \ddot         \ddot         dotdot
DotDot                  \Ddot
dyad                                  dyad
